3594 0 obj<</Border[0 0 0]/Contents(1)/F 64/Rect[1784 734 1796 742]/Subtype/Square/T(AutoCAD SHX Text)/NM(KKFJYGHAFHYHQVZE)/M(D:20260811142353-07'00')/AP<</N 3170 0 R>>/RD[0 0 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>1</p></body>)>>
