4857 0 obj<</Border[0 0 0]/Contents(PROVIDE AND INSTALL 3/4" CONDUIT WITH WIRES PER MANUFACTURER'S RECOMMENDATIONS AND AS REQUIRED FOR COMPLETE AND WORKABLE INSTALLATION PER HVAC CONTROL WIRING REQUIREMENTS. VERIFY EXACT LOCATION AND REQUIREMENTS WITH HVAC CONTRACTORS. PROVIDE 120V, 1-PHASE CONNECTION TO DDC CONTROL BOX \(MECHANICAL TO BOX \(MECHANICAL TO \(MECHANICAL TO CONFIRM\). PROVIDE DUCT DETECTORS PER MECHANICAL DRAWINGS AND INTERLOCK WITH FIRE ALARM SYSTEM TO SHUT DOWN THE UNIT UPON ACTIVATION OF SMOKE DETECTORS. REFER TO MECHANICAL DRAWINGS FOR EXACT LOCATION. PROVIDE MOTOR STARTER COMPLETE WITH HOA \(HAND/OFF AUTO\) SWITCH LOCKABLE DISCONNECT. STARTER SHALL BE MOUNTED INDEPENDENT OF FAN COIL WITH ALL WORKING CLEARANCES. PROVIDE WITH LIFE SAFETY SHUTOFF CONTACT AS REQUIRED. PROVIDE 120V, 1-PHASE CONNECTION TO CONDENSATE PUMP EACH WITH MOTOR RATED TOGGLE SWITCH DISCONNECT. TEN \(10\) CONDENSATE PUMPS OR LESS PER CIRCUIT. COORDINATE WITH MECHANICAL FOR QUANTITY AND LOCATION PRIOR TO ROUGH-IN. PROVIDE MOTOR RATED CONTROL. CONNECT WITH LIFE SAFETY SYSTEM FOR OVERRIDE AS NEEDED. PROVIDE LIFE SAFETY RELAY CONTACT AS REQUIRED. AMPERAGE PER UNIT REQUIREMENTS. PROVIDE 120V, 1-PHASE CONNECTION TO VAV, TEN \(10\) VAV OR LESS PER CIRCUIT. COORDINATE WITH MECHANICAL FOR QUANTITY AND LOCATION PRIOR TO ROUGH-IN. UNIT ALSO HAS AN ACCOMPANYING ROOFTOP UNIT. REFER TO MECHANICAL PLANS FOR FURTHER INFORMATION. INDOOR UNIT IS POWERED BY OUTDOOR UNIT. PROVIDE 120V, 1-PHASE CIRCUIT CONNECTION TO CSFD, TEN \(10\) CSFD OR LESS PER CIRCUIT. COORDINATE WITH MECHANICAL FOR QUANTITY AND LOCATION PRIOR TO ROUGH-IN. POWER VIA CIRCUIT 5L1B2-39. PROVIDE A WEATHER PROOF \(WP\) "EXTRA DUTY" TYPE ENCLOSURE FOR WEATHER RESISTANT \(WR\) GFCI RECEPTACLE WITH GALVANIZED STEEL UNISTRUT CHANNEL SUPPORTS, TO BE LOCATED WITHIN 25FT RADIUS OF MECHANICAL EQUIPMENT. CONSULT WITH ARCHITECT PRIOR TO ROUGH-IN.)/F 64/Rect[1350 332 1802 725]/Subtype/Square/T(AutoCAD SHX Text)/NM(ONVRZWUKWHZCYTQA)/M(D:20260811142354-07'00')/AP<</N 4317 0 R>>/RD[0 0 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>PROVIDE AND INSTALL 3/4" CONDUIT WITH WIRES PER MANUFACTURER'S RECOMMENDATIONS AND AS REQUIRED FOR COMPLETE AND WORKABLE INSTALLATION PER HVAC CONTROL WIRING REQUIREMENTS. VERIFY EXACT LOCATION AND REQUIREMENTS WITH HVAC CONTRACTORS. PROVIDE 120V, 1-PHASE CONNECTION TO DDC CONTROL BOX \(MECHANICAL TO BOX \(MECHANICAL TO \(MECHANICAL TO CONFIRM\). PROVIDE DUCT DETECTORS PER MECHANICAL DRAWINGS AND INTERLOCK WITH FIRE ALARM SYSTEM TO SHUT DOWN THE UNIT UPON ACTIVATION OF SMOKE DETECTORS. REFER TO MECHANICAL DRAWINGS FOR EXACT LOCATION. PROVIDE MOTOR STARTER COMPLETE WITH HOA \(HAND/OFF AUTO\) SWITCH LOCKABLE DISCONNECT. STARTER SHALL BE MOUNTED INDEPENDENT OF FAN COIL WITH ALL WORKING CLEARANCES. PROVIDE WITH LIFE SAFETY SHUTOFF CONTACT AS REQUIRED. PROVIDE 120V, 1-PHASE CONNECTION TO CONDENSATE PUMP EACH WITH MOTOR RATED TOGGLE SWITCH DISCONNECT. TEN \(10\) CONDENSATE PUMPS OR LESS PER CIRCUIT. COORDINATE WITH MECHANICAL FOR QUANTITY AND LOCATION PRIOR TO ROUGH-IN. PROVIDE MOTOR RATED CONTROL. CONNECT WITH LIFE SAFETY SYSTEM FOR OVERRIDE AS NEEDED. PROVIDE LIFE SAFETY RELAY CONTACT AS REQUIRED. AMPERAGE PER UNIT REQUIREMENTS. PROVIDE 120V, 1-PHASE CONNECTION TO VAV, TEN \(10\) VAV OR LESS PER CIRCUIT. COORDINATE WITH MECHANICAL FOR QUANTITY AND LOCATION PRIOR TO ROUGH-IN. UNIT ALSO HAS AN ACCOMPANYING ROOFTOP UNIT. REFER TO MECHANICAL PLANS FOR FURTHER INFORMATION. INDOOR UNIT IS POWERED BY OUTDOOR UNIT. PROVIDE 120V, 1-PHASE CIRCUIT CONNECTION TO CSFD, TEN \(10\) CSFD OR LESS PER CIRCUIT. COORDINATE WITH MECHANICAL FOR QUANTITY AND LOCATION PRIOR TO ROUGH-IN. POWER VIA CIRCUIT 5L1B2-39. PROVIDE A WEATHER PROOF \(WP\) "EXTRA DUTY" TYPE ENCLOSURE FOR WEATHER RESISTANT \(WR\) GFCI RECEPTACLE WITH GALVANIZED STEEL UNISTRUT CHANNEL SUPPORTS, TO BE LOCATED WITHIN 25FT RADIUS OF MECHANICAL EQUIPMENT. CONSULT WITH ARCHITECT PRIOR TO ROUGH-IN.</p></body>)>>
endobj
