4860 0 obj<</Border[0 0 0]/Contents(1. ALL ELECTRICAL EQUIPMENT AND DEVICES LOCATED ON THE ROOF SHALL BE WEATHERPROOF WITH NEMA ALL ELECTRICAL EQUIPMENT AND DEVICES LOCATED ON THE ROOF SHALL BE WEATHERPROOF WITH NEMA 3R RECEPTACLE AND IN-USE COVER. 2. ALL RECEPTACLE OUTLET LOCATED ON THE ROOF SHALL BE GFCI TYPE AND WEATHERPROOF WITH NEMA ALL RECEPTACLE OUTLET LOCATED ON THE ROOF SHALL BE GFCI TYPE AND WEATHERPROOF WITH NEMA 3R WITHIN USE COVER. 3. FOR EXACT LOCATION OF MECHANICAL EQUIPMENT ON THE ROOF, SEE MECHANICAL PLANS. FOR EXACT LOCATION OF MECHANICAL EQUIPMENT ON THE ROOF, SEE MECHANICAL PLANS. 4. ALL CONDUITS ON ROOF SHALL BE RUN PARALLEL WITH STRUCTURES. PROVIDE J-BOX AT EVERY THREE ALL CONDUITS ON ROOF SHALL BE RUN PARALLEL WITH STRUCTURES. PROVIDE J-BOX AT EVERY THREE 90\260 CONDUIT BENDS AS REQUIRED BY N.E.C. 5. EXACT LOCATION OF ALL DISCONNECT SWITCH SHOWN ON THIS PLAN ARE TO BE FIELD COORDINATED WITH EXACT LOCATION OF ALL DISCONNECT SWITCH SHOWN ON THIS PLAN ARE TO BE FIELD COORDINATED WITH HVAC CONTRACTOR PRIOR TO ALL ROUGH-IN WORK. 6. MAKE PROVISIONS FOR CONTROL CONDUITS TO ALL ROOF MOUNTED HVAC EQUIPMENT, WHERE DICTATED MAKE PROVISIONS FOR CONTROL CONDUITS TO ALL ROOF MOUNTED HVAC EQUIPMENT, WHERE DICTATED ON HVAC PLANS AND NOT SHOWN ON THIS PLAN. REMOTE CONTROL LOCATION ARE TO BE COORDINATED WITH HVAC PLANS. 7. PROVIDE UNISTRUT CHANNEL SUPPORT AND BRACKETS FOR MOUNTING OF PANELBOARD, DISCONNECT PROVIDE UNISTRUT CHANNEL SUPPORT AND BRACKETS FOR MOUNTING OF PANELBOARD, DISCONNECT SWITCHES AND RECEPTACLES WHERE NO STRUCTURE OR OTHER MEANS OF MOUNTING THE DEVICES CURRENTLY EXIST. ELECTRICAL EQUIPMENT OR DEVICES SHALL IN NO CIRCUMSTANCE SHALL BE MOUNTED OR SUPPORTED DIRECTLY FROM A ROOFTOP AHU UNIT. 8. WHERE DUCT DETECTORS ARE REQUIRED PER HVAC DRAWINGS AND NOT SHOWN ON THIS PLAN, PROVIDE WHERE DUCT DETECTORS ARE REQUIRED PER HVAC DRAWINGS AND NOT SHOWN ON THIS PLAN, PROVIDE 3/4"C EXTENDING DOWN TO FIRE LIFE SAFETY SYSTEM IN THE BUILDING. )/F 64/Rect[615 328 854 753]/Subtype/Square/T(AutoCAD SHX Text)/NM(HHPQTGSVZUCUYDND)/M(D:20260811142354-07'00')/AP<</N 4320 0 R>>/RD[0 0 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>1. ALL ELECTRICAL EQUIPMENT AND DEVICES LOCATED ON THE ROOF SHALL BE WEATHERPROOF WITH NEMA ALL ELECTRICAL EQUIPMENT AND DEVICES LOCATED ON THE ROOF SHALL BE WEATHERPROOF WITH NEMA 3R RECEPTACLE AND IN-USE COVER. 2. ALL RECEPTACLE OUTLET LOCATED ON THE ROOF SHALL BE GFCI TYPE AND WEATHERPROOF WITH NEMA ALL RECEPTACLE OUTLET LOCATED ON THE ROOF SHALL BE GFCI TYPE AND WEATHERPROOF WITH NEMA 3R WITHIN USE COVER. 3. FOR EXACT LOCATION OF MECHANICAL EQUIPMENT ON THE ROOF, SEE MECHANICAL PLANS. FOR EXACT LOCATION OF MECHANICAL EQUIPMENT ON THE ROOF, SEE MECHANICAL PLANS. 4. ALL CONDUITS ON ROOF SHALL BE RUN PARALLEL WITH STRUCTURES. PROVIDE J-BOX AT EVERY THREE ALL CONDUITS ON ROOF SHALL BE RUN PARALLEL WITH STRUCTURES. PROVIDE J-BOX AT EVERY THREE 90\260 CONDUIT BENDS AS REQUIRED BY N.E.C. 5. EXACT LOCATION OF ALL DISCONNECT SWITCH SHOWN ON THIS PLAN ARE TO BE FIELD COORDINATED WITH EXACT LOCATION OF ALL DISCONNECT SWITCH SHOWN ON THIS PLAN ARE TO BE FIELD COORDINATED WITH HVAC CONTRACTOR PRIOR TO ALL ROUGH-IN WORK. 6. MAKE PROVISIONS FOR CONTROL CONDUITS TO ALL ROOF MOUNTED HVAC EQUIPMENT, WHERE DICTATED MAKE PROVISIONS FOR CONTROL CONDUITS TO ALL ROOF MOUNTED HVAC EQUIPMENT, WHERE DICTATED ON HVAC PLANS AND NOT SHOWN ON THIS PLAN. REMOTE CONTROL LOCATION ARE TO BE COORDINATED WITH HVAC PLANS. 7. PROVIDE UNISTRUT CHANNEL SUPPORT AND BRACKETS FOR MOUNTING OF PANELBOARD, DISCONNECT PROVIDE UNISTRUT CHANNEL SUPPORT AND BRACKETS FOR MOUNTING OF PANELBOARD, DISCONNECT SWITCHES AND RECEPTACLES WHERE NO STRUCTURE OR OTHER MEANS OF MOUNTING THE DEVICES CURRENTLY EXIST. ELECTRICAL EQUIPMENT OR DEVICES SHALL IN NO CIRCUMSTANCE SHALL BE MOUNTED OR SUPPORTED DIRECTLY FROM A ROOFTOP AHU UNIT. 8. WHERE DUCT DETECTORS ARE REQUIRED PER HVAC DRAWINGS AND NOT SHOWN ON THIS PLAN, PROVIDE WHERE DUCT DETECTORS ARE REQUIRED PER HVAC DRAWINGS AND NOT SHOWN ON THIS PLAN, PROVIDE 3/4"C EXTENDING DOWN TO FIRE LIFE SAFETY SYSTEM IN THE BUILDING. </p></body>)>>
endobj
